  "name": "Steller Sea Lion Counts",
  "description": "A compilation of counts of Steller sea lions observed on land at sites along the north Pacific rim from 1958 to the present. Annual summer counts (collected periodically since 1958) made at 151 locations in the Aleutians and Gulf of Alaska are machine-readable format.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To report on the Steller sea lion counts.",
